meta {
  name: 7. Data Access
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{DATA_PLANE_ENDPOINT}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{DATA_PLANE_AUTH}}
}

docs {
  Fetch the actual data from the Provider's data plane using the EDR token.

  The data plane proxies this request to the backend data source configured in the Provider's asset definition.

  A successful response contains the data from the Provider's backend — this confirms the full E2E data exchange lifecycle is working:
  Catalog → Negotiation → Transfer → EDR → Data Access
}
